<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>A Little Birthday Surprise</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">A little celebration</p>
      <div class="cake" aria-hidden="true">🎂</div>

      <h1>Happy Birthday!</h1>

      <p class="intro">
        Today is all about celebrating someone wonderful.
        May your day be filled with smiles, love, and lovely surprises.
      </p>

      <button id="surpriseButton" class="button" type="button">
        Open your surprise 💌
      </button>

      <p id="surpriseMessage" class="surprise-message hidden" aria-live="polite">
        You deserve all the happiness, love, and beautiful surprises in the world! 💗
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="note-section">
      <h2>A little birthday note</h2>

      <div class="message-card">
        <p>
          I hope this new year of your life brings you wonderful memories,
          exciting adventures, and countless reasons to smile.
        </p>
        <p>
          Keep being your lovely self. You make the world a little brighter!
        </p>
        <span class="heart">With love, always ♡</span>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    Made with love and a little bit of magic ✨
  </footer>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>

